---
title: Vietnamese phin by Copper Cow Coffee
source: https://coppercowcoffee.com/blogs/blog-posts/how-to-use-a-phin
---

@Phin 14g 4floz 190-205°F
grind medium-fine

/level-bed -- shake lightly, then set the press on the grounds without packing them
1floz bloom
/wait ~60s
4floz -- fill the chamber to the top, then put the lid on
/drawdown -- 3 to 5 minutes in total; add sweetened condensed milk to taste
